            <span class="eyebrow reveal" data-es="Especial 4 de Julio &middot; Descuentos de Verano y Rodadas">July 4th Event &middot; Summer Markdowns, Hydration &amp; Trail Rides</span>
            <h2 class="h2 reveal" data-es="Promos de verano. <em>Listos para rodar.</em>">Summer promos &amp; <em>trail-ready gear.</em></h2>
